    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51158" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσο-στάσιος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>equal in weight</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσός,
				χρυσίον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				4.4.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>CG</u>
				17
			</span></i>; <i>equivalent</i> or <i>adequate</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
